      "song_duration_ms": 9822
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Night is not the sun shutting off. We spin! At midnight the sunlight is bright on the far side.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_064/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8568,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10239
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Starlight is old. A star is so high up that its light left long ago, and tonight you get it.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_064/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8777,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10475
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Green plants eat light. In a bright spot, a plant makes food out of sunlight. No light, no food.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_064/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8045,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10605
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Sunlight is the brightest light. A bulb and a candle make light. A firefly makes light in its tail!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_064/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8881,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10318
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Lights can tell you things. A red light means stop, a green light means go. Get that right!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_064/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8724,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8750
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "A light on a high rock blinks all night. A ship reads it: keep right of the island!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_064/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6817,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_064/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8045
    },
    {
